export default [{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["a fox named coyote","Key Otter","Cornel","DragoVox"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,13,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_0_","Title":"A Fox Named Coyote In Concert","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"A Fox Named Coyote and the Not-Foxes Not Named Coyote bring a spectacularly spooky show to the Haunted Masquerade! Get ready for an ominous hour of pop, punk, and prog!"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Gazzy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,21,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 09:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_1_","Title":"A Very Gazzy Trivia Game","Room":"Sponsor's Lounge","Abstract":"Attempt to outwit and befuddle Gazzy, your Head of Hospitality, in a trivia game where they know the answers and pray that YOU don’t! Fabulous prizes and glory await the winner! Can you face off against this oddball Trivia game? Only Gazzy knows!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["The F2 AV Team"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,20,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 08:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_2_","Title":"AV 101- How Do?","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Ever been to a concert or dance and found out that you were actually more interested in the lights, sound, or video? Ever thought that you might enjoy helping run those things but don't know where to start? Are you just bored and want to chat with the AV team? Come learn what goes into running AV at FurSquared! No experience required!"},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Rouge"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,10,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 AM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_3_","Title":"All Ages Sketchbook Swap","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Leave your sketchbook on the pile, pick up another one, and add a drawing for the sketchbook's owner! This event is a casual art trading space for all ages."},{"tags":[""],"Speakers":["OxideFox","Nitrous Fox","Roscoe Rohernstern"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,10,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_4_","Title":"An Introduction to Model Trains: What, How, and Why?","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Have you ever been curious about getting into the model railroad/railway hobby? If so, come join us as we wax poetic (see: rant) about model trains for an hour! We will be talking about how we got into the hobby and answering questions like \"How much space do you actually need? How much can this cost?\" and any others you may throw at us!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Yonek Yote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,14,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 02:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_5_","Title":"Animal Jam Made Me a Furry!","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Calling all Jammers! Are you a major Animal Jam (AJ) fan? Whether you’re new to the game(s), a veteran from the beta days of AJ Classic, or a tablet jammer of Play Wild, come join us for a dive into the world of Jamaa, discussions, lore, trivia, tips/secrets, and appreciation over its floofy, awesome critters! Bring your laptop/devices to play and socialize! Bring memorabilia to show and tell!"},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Candy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,19,30],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 07:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_6_","Title":"Artist Trading Cards","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Artist trading cards, also known as ATCs or ACEOs, are miniature pieces of art that you can trade and collect! Grab your art supplies or borrow from mine (limited!) and make some with me! All ages and skill levels welcome."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Hal Aetus"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,20,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 08:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_7_","Title":"Avian Anatomy","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Learn about the amazing anatomy of birds, and how they are uniquely adapted to a flying lifestyle, from an avian veterinarian. There will be a PowerPoint presentation followed by open question and answer time, so bring your questions!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Citrine Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,20,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 08:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_8_","Title":"Babyfur Meet and Greet and Discussion","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Are you a Babyfur or a member of the ABDL community or are you just curious as to what this section of the fandom is about? Come join us for an hour of discussion and mingling and making new friends."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["LycanthropyLive"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,14,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 02:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_9_","Title":"Badge Art Jam!","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Come make badges with us! Artists (and non-artists) of all skill levels are welcome to join.   Some materials will be provided, but feel free to bring your own!   Laminator sheets & doodle badges done by Lycan will be available for a donation to this year’s charity. :)"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Dustin DaHusky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,11,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_10_","Title":"Basics to Running Furmeets","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Ever wanted to start a social gathering for your local community, but not sure how? Come ask Dustin DaHusky, who has had long time experience running furmeets since 2012, for some insight on the basics of running a successful furmeet. Learn to be a pillar of your community! Are you a furmeet organizer too? Come join us and share your experiences with the panel!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Ettics Broadwings"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,13,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 01:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_11_","Title":"Bird Meet & Tweet","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A meetup for bird friends to get together and clack beaks at the convention. Whether you're all bird, part bird, like birds, or friends of a bird, feel free to drop in and enjoy casual conversations and sticker swaps in a relaxed atmosphere. Plus, stick around for a casual, likely amateur group photo to capture the memories!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Vixie"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,16,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_12_","Title":"Blåhaj 101","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Learn all about Blåhaj! Key points include: How to pronounce Blåhaj, how to make your own Blåhajsona, how to style your Blåhaj, and how to best hold the Blåhaj. Come and mingle with other friends of Blåhaj and learn the ways of the plushie shark."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Zorvis Fox"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,18,30],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 06:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_13_","Title":"Board Games: Not So Scary","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Interested in board gaming, but need someone to guide you into the hobby? Love the classics, but want to hear what’s new? Need suggestions for running a haunted-themed game night? Want a chance to win a free game? This panel is for you."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Vix / Sage"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,14,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 02:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_14_","Title":"Book Swap & Origami Basics","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Looking to share your favorite reads with someone? Interested in learning some origami? Stop by my book swap to tell us all about your favorite books, and bring a copy to share! I will also be providing paper and teaching several origami patterns for those interested!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Boozy Badger"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,15,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_15_","Title":"Boozy's Basic Law","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Are you getting law advice from Reddit? Do you believe you don’t need a lawyer because “you’ve seen enough Law and Order”? Boozy tells you why you’re wrong, and explains common misconceptions about the legal system."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Boozy Badger","Alkali"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,13,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 01:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_16_","Title":"Boozy's Legal Funhouse","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Boozy and his legal layman, Alkali Bismuth, discuss legal news, with an explanation of how the legal principles are truly messed up. The pair look at an actual legal case, current or historical, in a lighthearted and profane manner as Boozy tries to get Alkali to understand the law really can be made up as one goes along."},{"tags":["Fursuit Related"],"Track":"Fursuit","Speakers":["Soma Coyote","Lilia Roo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,11,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 AM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_17_","Title":"Bronze Fonz Fur Walk","Room":"Hotel Lower Lobby","Abstract":"Join us for another Bronze Fonz Fur Walk! We will start with group fursuit photos at Vel R Phillips Plaza by the con hotel. We'll walk east, stopping for group photos at public art pieces along the way. Then we'll take a short walk up the river to get group photos with Bronze Fonz! After that, we'll head back to the hotel."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Faelan","Alkali","Draggor","MLW","Kashi"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,21,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 09:30 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_18_","Title":"CHAIRity AD...&D","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Join game-master Faelan as he subjects your con chair and special guests to a side-splitting adventure...After Dark! The more money you throw at charity, the more hilarious hazards I throw in their way!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Codes"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,10,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_19_","Title":"Cartoons Made Me A Furry!","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"You ever just stop and wonder why you became a furry? Your childhood cartoons may be the reason! In this panel, Fiver Bunny will analyze the history of animation and cartoons while explaining how it manages to somehow tie into the development of many furries and how it continues to shape the lives of many in the fandom!"},{"tags":["Convention"],"Track":"Convention","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy Badger","Pandez"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,10,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 10:00 AM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_20_","Title":"Charity Auction","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Come one, come all to the auction hall! Where fantastic ghouls and ghosts have unearthed all kinds of shiny trinkets that could be yours, and yours alone...if you are the highest bidder!"},{"tags":["Dance"],"Track":"Dance","Speakers":["Tango Bloom"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_21_","Title":"Charity Dance Off","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Come see some amazing performers fight for the dance throne at CDO! This dance battle combines the excitement of a tournament with an awesome opportunity to raise funds for our charity. You as an audience are able to vote for your favorite dancers with these donations, and give them a shot at their own unique placement, the Charity Pick! Make sure not to miss this inspiring event!"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Alkali","Draggor","Boozy Badger","Pepper Coyote","Iggy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,16,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_22_","Title":"Charity Whose Lion is it Anyway?","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Come out and see some of the funniest people in the fandom performing in Improv games. This 100% off the cuff event will go to support our charity, so come one come all and see some of your favorite funny furs make fools of themselves. As with any Improv event, audience participation is bound to happen."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Tapioca"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,20,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 08:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_23_","Title":"Church of Garf","Room":"Empire","Abstract":"Garfield fans rejoice, church is back in town! Join us for the 3rd year of church of Garf as we celebrate our love, our everything, Garfield.  In this panel we will draw cursed Garfield's, supplies will be provided but bringing your own supplies is encouraged."},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Citrine Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_24_","Title":"Citrine In Concert","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Come join Citrine the fandom’s own blind singing husky for an hour of music and entertainment."},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Citrine Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,22,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_25_","Title":"Citrine's Chaotic Charity Concert","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Do you love our charity? Of course you do. Do you also love music?  Come join the fandom’s blind singing husky and donate some money to charity to get the chance to force Citrine to sing some of the weirdest songs imaginable.  It’s simple, throw some money in the hat and pull a random artist name out of the hat.  Let the chaos begin!"},{"tags":["Convention"],"Track":"Convention","Speakers":["Axel Malamute","MLW","Kashiru"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,18,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 06:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_26_","Title":"Closing Ceremonies","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"As the curtain falls on the Haunted Masquerade, come to main events to reflect on the weekend past. At FurSquared's Closing Ceremonies, learn about what all was accomplished over the weekend in terms of charity and the number of happy haunts roaming the halls. As the masquerade grows still and we ready ourselves to return to the mortal plane, perhaps you'll even gaze into a crystal ball for a glimpse at what's to come!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Con History","Bash the Piñata"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,23,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 11:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_27_","Title":"Con History: From Costume Masquerade to Fursuit Parade","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"From the first costumes at Worldcon in 1939 to the massive cosplay events of today join us for a look of over 85 years of dressing up in the convention scene, from costume masquerades to filk music to  room parties to cosplay contests to fursuit events"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy Badger"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,15,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_28_","Title":"Convention War Stories","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Come out and see what happens behind the closed doors of conventions. Sit back and listen to the stories that you were never meant to find out about from our panel of convention staff and board members. Enjoy the stories and find out why that cop was shaking his head well laughing."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Mongrel Skullsworth"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,22,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_29_","Title":"Cursed Sketchbook Swap","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Come share cursed conversation and cursed creations with fellow cursed drawing enthusiasts! Be sure to bring your own sketchbook supplies and/or other means of creation!"},{"tags":["Other"],"Track":"Other","Speakers":["Slug"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,15,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 03:30 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_30_","Title":"DBF Dress Rehearsal","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"This is a closed event for Down Bad Furlesque staff. Please only attend if you have been requested to do so."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Ziggy Darkglow","Malphas","Xeireiz"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,10,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_31_","Title":"Darkglow Fitness","Room":"S201","Abstract":"An event normally hosted on VRChat, brought to you in real life! Join Ziggy Darkglow, a certified personal trainer for some fitness introductions! Get ready to work up a little sweat and \"grab fitness by the horns\"!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Serathin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,20,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 08:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_32_","Title":"Dead Dog Karaoke","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Not ready to say good-bye to the con and want to belt it out?  Join in on some after-con karaoke and sing the PCD away!"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Slug"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,18,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 06:30 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_33_","Title":"Down Bad Furlesque","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"DBF is an adult variety show mixing the art of acting, dance, and fursuiting! Come witness the magic of the stage as our performers put on a top-notch show for you! Like what you see? Toss some money! Our event proudly gives to the convention's charity!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Scribbles"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,16,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_34_","Title":"Drawing Challenges","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"An interactive drawing event where creativity meets fun! Participants will tackle a series of fun and quirky challenges, while showcasing their artistic skills. With timed challenges and surprise themes, everyone from beginners to experienced artists will find something to inspire them. Join me for a fun time filled with laughter, creativity, and a chance to explore your potential."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Gretri"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,22,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_35_","Title":"Fat Furs Meet and Greet","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"For those furries into the rounder side of things, this is the social gathering for you! This meet and greet presents furries who love bigger and plus sized furs, whether you draw them or just like big bellies in general. Come and discuss your favorite stuff about fat furs!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Middknyte"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,16,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 04:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_36_","Title":"Finding Fun in Fighting Games","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Have you wanted to play a fighting game but didn't know where to start? Have you felt it was \"not your thing\" but you wish it was? Well, I surely can't teach you how to \"get good\" immediately, but I can show you how to have fun with it!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Gazzy","Gazzy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,17,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 05:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_37_","Title":"Foam Combat Furs Meet-Up","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A meetup for those who participate in the Belegarth Medieval Combat Society (or other adjacent games). All are welcome, from long time veterans to new and interested fighters!"},{"tags":["Convention"],"Track":"Convention","Speakers":["FurSquared"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,19,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 07:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_38_","Title":"Formal Haunted Masquerade","Room":"Empire","Abstract":"A grand ballroom, where the air is thick with mystery and a touch of eerie enchantment. Cobwebs line the corners, as the faint light falls from dimly lit chandeliers, all mingling with the rustling sound of silk and satin as guests and ghosts move about. Haunting melodies and newfound friends. Are they specters? Does it matter? This is where the boundary between the living and the supernatural blurs, and anything might happen under a mask worn in dark light."},{"tags":["Gaming / Competition"],"Track":"Games","Speakers":["Chanur"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,10,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 10:00 AM, 240 minutes","key":"_event_39_","Title":"FurSquared Annual Charity Poker Tournament","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"We're back again to show off who's got the face, and who's got the stone cold nuts! Texas Hold'em is our featured game again and play against your fellow furs for bragging rights and some great prizes as we raise money for HAWS for the fifth straight year. While not required, a small donation for the charity is always appreciated!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["CCritt93","Nikolai","Lord PichuPal"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,24,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 12:00 AM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_40_","Title":"Furry Card Sharks","Room":"S201","Abstract":"The classic TV game of higher and lower—with a furry twist! Players predict how furry fans responded to poll questions, then test their luck against the cards. Winners receive a small prize and play the Money Cards for HAWS! (Slates and chalk available for nonspeaking players.)"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Pepper Coyote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,15,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 03:30 PM, 30 minutes","key":"_event_41_","Title":"Furry Choir","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Come hear the Furry Choir! We've rehearsed once, and we're ready for the big time. This choir is entirely made of convention-goers and if you want to be a part of it, check the schedule, come to the rehearsal, and join the fun!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Pepper Coyote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,10,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 AM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_42_","Title":"Furry Choir Rehearsal - Open to the public!","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Ever wanted to sing in a choir? Are you an experienced choir person? We want YOU! Come to rehearsal, practice the music, and perform with us later at the convention. All experience levels are welcome,  no experience required."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Shiloh Skye"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,24,30],"Date":"Monday","Time":"Monday @ 12:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_43_","Title":"Furry Fiction Showcase","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A panel for furry readers! Come watch a dog who reads way too many books tell you about the best furry fiction of the year. I'll give you the resources you need to get your paws on great furry stories from great furry writers. You might even leave with a free book!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["CCritt93","Nikolai"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,15,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 03:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_44_","Title":"Furry Language: The Game Show!","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Let your fur do the talking! In this twist on furry charades based on TV’s “Body Language,” teams of two use pantomime to convey clues to furry-themed puzzles. Winners receive a small prize and play a bonus round for HAWS! (Fursuiters, please note that every player has to speak at some point in the game.)"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["n/a"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,24,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 12:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_45_","Title":"Furry Merch Swap Meet","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Bring your pins, stickers, key chains, plushies and more to swap with your fellow furries! This is for the trading of items, no monetary exchanges please."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Tango Bloom","Slade","Kylo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,13,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 01:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_46_","Title":"Furry Smash or Pass (18+)","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Come sound off as Tango & friends rank some beloved (and some less so) popular furry characters on whether they’d tell them to hit the road or hit it themselves."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Mars"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,19,0],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 07:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_47_","Title":"Furry Survivor!","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Based on the popular game show “Survivor” your host Mars will put your artistic, intellectual, and physical skills to the test in this contest to see who wins our cash prize!"},{"tags":["Dance"],"Track":"Dance","Speakers":["Tango Bloom","Kito (GOH)"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,15,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 03:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_48_","Title":"Fursuit Dance Competition","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Make sure you don't miss one of the most popular events a furry con will host, the Fursuit Dance Competition! Here you will see some of the most talented furries perform routines to a panel of judges. Who will take home the trophy this year? Let's find out."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Soma Coyote","Lilia Roo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,15,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 03:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_49_","Title":"Furwaukee Meet n Greet","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"See online friends, meet new furs, and relax in a fun, sensory-friendly space. Learn more about the Milwaukee furry community as we showcase some past events and preview upcoming ones! We'll also be taking group photos, so bring your fursuit if you have one! We'll also be raising funds for Friends of MADACC, to benefit the puppies and kitties at the local shelter."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Gazzy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,23,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_50_","Title":"Gazzy's Goblet Séance","Room":"Sponsor's Lounge","Abstract":"The Goblet Gauntlet is back, and this time, Hydration is making a comeback! Join Gazzy as they show, talk, and (possibly) drink out of their fabulous Goblet collection. This year the gauntlet (or goblet) is being raised (within reason) all in the name for charity! Will there be shenanigans? Yes! Will there be water? YES."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Tundra"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,20,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 08:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_51_","Title":"Ghost Hunting 101","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Ever wonder what goes into paranormal investigations or ghost hunting? Tundra is here to answer your questions and show interesting tips and tricks!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Soma Coyote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,14,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 02:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_52_","Title":"Guitar Bassics","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Have you ever wished you could learn to play guitar or bass? Good news, you can! Soma Coyote will explain basics about guitar, bass, and some history of the instruments in rock and other genres. Featuring a live demonstration where you can play a guitar and bass!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Shallie Dragon"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,13,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_53_","Title":"Home Vocal Recording on a Budget","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Do you want to record vocals, but don't know where to start? I can help you with that! This panel will cover the basics of home vocal recording, and provide equipment suggestions for a variety of budgets. I'll teach you how to make your ideas a reality, without breaking the bank!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Dustin DaHusky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,15,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 03:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_54_","Title":"Hoosk Meet and Greet!","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"If you find yourself zooming, swirling, and screaming, you're likely a husky! Come stop on by and say hello if your sona is a husky or a hybrid, have an actual hoosk at home, or a fan of this cool breed of dog. Let’s all scream together! =D"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["the ghosts"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,12,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 12:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_55_","Title":"Hotel-wide Ghost Hunt Challenge","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Meet me at the [Location TBD] at the stroke of midnight. I'll explain the rules, then turn you loose to find as many of us as you can. Bring your flashlights, and remember you must show up by midnight to participate."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Myself"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,24,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 12:00 AM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_56_","Title":"How To Electrician","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Ever been shocked by a wall plug? I’ve lost count, but I'll teach you how to avoid it! Join me for a quick overview of what goes on behind the light bulbs, switches, and plugs in your house! And enjoy a furry take on the trades!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Gale Tazzin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,19,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 07:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_57_","Title":"How to Draw Mustelids","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Learn about members of the weasel family and important attributes for drawing them! Hosted by a professional biologist who studied the slinkies and stinkies and now has a webcomic full of them. No art skill required!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Arlo Grimes"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_58_","Title":"Hyena Meet and Greet","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Hello hyenas! Come do some coloring and crafting while you meet (or catch up with) local yeens! Hyenas, scavengers, and hyena enthusiasts are all welcome. Crafts/coloring will be provided, only while supplies last."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,20,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 08:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_59_","Title":"I Comedy Better When I've Had A Few","Room":"S201","Abstract":"I have no idea what is going to happen at this charity event, but it is for a good cause. Show up, throw some money into the hat and enjoy the show. And for those of you that asked for this on twitter… I hope you’re happy."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Pike","Dittman Rat"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,15,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 03:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_60_","Title":"I Have a Fursuit... Now What? (Fursuiting 101)","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Have a fursuit but have no idea how to perform in it? Then this is the perfect panel for you! Experienced fursuiter, dancer and performer, Pike, will be sharing their insight on how they perform in suit as their characters and more. This panel is for everyone, young and old, new or experienced!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Status Ferret"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,20,0],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 08:00 PM, 30 minutes","key":"_event_61_","Title":"I've Been to Nick Wilde's House","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Ever wonder what it's like to work for the mouse? Come learn all about the Disney College Program from someone who experienced it first hand, and hear some ridiculous tales of the most magical place on earth."},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Iggy","Keyotter","Rhubarb","Gale Tazzin","Citrine","Yzorah","Status Ferret"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,24,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_62_","Title":"Iggy and Friends' Music Show","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"A variety music show featuring a variety of musicians in the fandom."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Iggy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,13,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 01:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_63_","Title":"Iggy's Being Sketchy","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A really special one-dinosaur show Iggy put together consisting of comedy and reflection.  If you ever watched an ABC Primetime special, yes."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Iggy","Alkali","Boozy Badger","Status"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,16,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_64_","Title":"Iggy's Game Show For Guinea Pigs","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A game show with a bunch of different games.  Get a question correct, reveal pieces off of a Rebus puzzle.  If your team can guess the puzzle, you win!"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Iggy","TBA"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,12,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_65_","Title":"Iggy's Games For A Midnight Crowd","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A completely self-indulgent panel.  You did read the title right?"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Iggy","Alkali","Boozy Badger","Pokerwolf","Citrine","Chris","and more"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,14,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 02:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_66_","Title":"Iggy's Improv Hour","Room":"S201","Abstract":"A challenging hour of improv where Iggy tortures friends to do difficult and lesser known improv games, including long form improv and games you typically do not see played."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Iggy","Alkali","Pandez"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,11,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_67_","Title":"Iggy's Pyramid","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"A game show where you and a celebrity guest compete to conquer the Pyramid! The game consists of listing things loudly until your teammate says the thing you're describing."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Iggy","Shiloh Skye","Serathin","TBA"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,10,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 10:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_68_","Title":"Iggy's Storytellers","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A panel for those that enjoy written works.  Panelists will share readings and discussion on their own works and those they find interesting/inspiring."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Zen","That 360 Furry"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,16,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 04:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_69_","Title":"Improv 360° Videos with Friends","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Join That 360 Furry and friends for a dynamic workshop on immersive 360° video filmmaking! Following my introduction to the art of 360° content creation and storytelling, attendees will have the opportunity to collaborate in groups, practice their lines, and record their own improvised scenes in stunning 8K 360° video to share!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Iggy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_70_","Title":"Improv Workshop","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Having trouble thinking on your feet?  New to improv or want to hone your skills?  Then this is the panel for you!  We will present some of the core fundamentals of improvisation comedy and have you (yes, YOU!) come up and perform your favorite improv games."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Draggor"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,17,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 05:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_71_","Title":"Intro to Alternative Role Playing Game Systems","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"You've probably heard of Dungeons & Dragons, and maybe even played it!  Are you curious about what other games are out there?  Great!  We'll be doing a modest review of two systems, Delta Green and Genesys, while touching on some others like Inspectres, Troika!, and more!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Shallie Dragon"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,15,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_72_","Title":"Intro to Music Production","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Do you want to get your music on Spotify? Do you have a song idea, but no clue how to make it a reality? This panel is for you. This beginner-focused presentation will explain how to produce music with computer software. I'll teach you basic sound design, arrangement, recording, mixing, and distribution, without breaking your budget!"},{"tags":["Other"],"Track":"Other","Speakers":["Reverb Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,16,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_73_","Title":"Intro to Radio Control Vehicles!","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"This is a brief introduction into the world of radio control vehicles! On display will be a handful of different models from racing drones to nitro vehicles. Reverb will be answering the questions such as “How do I get started,” “what kind of RC car should I buy,” “how much does this cost?”"},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Purple DragonMage"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,12,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_74_","Title":"Intro to Rubber Crafting","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Want to get started in the wonderful world of rubber crafting with latex? Join Purple DragonMage for an introduction on how easy it can be to make and repair your own latex outfits and gear. Learn the basics of cutting, gluing, zippers and pattern making and have your crafting questions answered."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Koda"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,10,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 10:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_75_","Title":"Intro to Weight Training","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"For anyone who’s considered picking up weight training but wasn’t sure where to start, here’s a crash course! This panel will cover the basics for those wanting to train such as varying methods based on goals and the do's and don’ts for seeing results. Time will also be taken to dispel various myths around the topic and demonstrate just how accessible — and possible —weight training can be for all."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Hobart","N/A"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,11,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 11:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_76_","Title":"Investor-Owned Utilities: a Rambling","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"You know how someone has to deliver gas, water, and electricity to your abode? Have you ever wondered what kind of goofy stuff happens if a for-profit monopoly happens to be doing it? Hobart has answers, and he wants to give them to you in a Pibb-fueled utility-themed extravaganza!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Serathin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,24,0],"Date":"Monday","Time":"Monday @ 12:00 AM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_77_","Title":"Jackbox Party Time","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Break out the phones, it's time to party!  Join host Serathin as he brings the ultimate party that anyone can play!  Playing everything from Murder Mystery Trivia to Guesspionage and so much more!"},{"tags":["Other"],"Track":"Other","Speakers":["a fox named coyote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,12,0],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 12:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_78_","Title":"Just How Haunted is This Masquerade?","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Hey Google, how do you hold a seance?"},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["SIN","MLW?"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,21,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 09:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_79_","Title":"Kaiju Kafe Vibe Art Hour","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Chill vibes and tea, come to the Kaiju Kafe to relax, sip tea and draw art."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Slimy Opossum","Neon Vixie","Jaxon the Forgi","V01D0G"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,22,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 10:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_80_","Title":"Kandi 101","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Are you a kandi newbie, curious about bead bracelets? A kandi pro who wants a place to relax and make kandi among friends? Or something in between? Come join us for Kandi 101! We'll give a brief intro to kandi history + kulture and show off some sweet secret bead skills, all while making and trading everything kandi. All supplies will be provided, but you are welcome to bring your own too!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Shallie Dragon"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,15,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_81_","Title":"Let's Record a Song in an Hour!","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"I've got a microphone and a computer, but I need your help! Come to the panel ready to bark, chirp, stomp, and clap, and I'll record you. Then I'll take your sounds, mash and mangle them, and use them to build out a song, which I will perform at the end of the panel."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Shasta","Snowfeather"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_82_","Title":"Let's look at birds","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Birdwatching may be the best hobby one can have. Let us share with you everything from adventures tracking rare birds abroad to the comfortable joys of transforming a backyard into a little wildlife oasis. Birding can enrich your life from helping to pursue various hobbies to the variety of citizen science projects you can be proud of having participated in at the end of the day. Birds <3"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Alkali"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_83_","Title":"Live Action Role-play Furs","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Do you put on armor, run around in the forest throwing bird seed packets or just try to kill your friends with a rousing game of paper rock scissors? Well this is the panel to talk of all things LARP. Join Alkali and his 15+ years of LARP experience for this open discussion on the life of a Live Action Role-player. Please leave your dice at the door, they are not needed here."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Lune"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,11,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 11:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_84_","Title":"Lune's Language Lectures","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Ever wanted to learn fun things about language? Want to be a linguist but without the boring bits? Enjoy tik toks too much so your attention span is fried? Good. Come join your local lagomorph Lune as he takes you through 3-4 20 minute or less language lectures."},{"tags":["Gaming / Competition"],"Track":"Games","Speakers":["ThreeFoxxes"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,22,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 10:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_85_","Title":"Lupus in Tabula","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Your village has a problem. A werewolf problem. Every night the werewolves rise up with a hunger for human flesh. Your only hope is to work together with your fellow villagers to discover which among you is secretly a bloodthirsty beast, and put them on the chopping block! Join us as we play this fandom favorite social deduction game!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy Badger","Pepper","Draggor","Iggy & so many more!"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,21,0],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 09:00 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_86_","Title":"MST3K","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Mystery Science Theatre 3000 – furry style! Come join Alkali as we (and probably the whole room full of people) verbally rip a movie of our choosing to shreds! Hopefully this year’s movie will NOT have center screen wipes."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Grim"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,13,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 01:30 PM, 120 minutes","key":"_event_87_","Title":"Make your own dice!","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Want to make your own dice or work with resin?  Now is your chance to learn techniques, steps to get better, and how to stay safe!  The first half of the panel will be an instructional and the second half of the panel will be a dice inking workshop!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Sawyer","Seanathan"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,15,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_88_","Title":"Marine & Greet: Aquatic Furs","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A meet and greet for marine furries. Stop by for a meet and greet for hybrids of or species of seals, fishes, porpoises, mollusks, otters, penguins, other sea birds, and so on. Fursuit not required— artists or curious folk are all welcome to visit. Sea you there!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Boozy Badger","Iggy","Alkali","QM"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,20,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 08:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_89_","Title":"Mass Debation","Room":"S201","Abstract":"A charity debate panel where you vote with your dollars. Three debates on irrelevant topics picked from the audience, argued irreverently by the panelists, with the audience picking the winner."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Lune"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,23,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 11:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_90_","Title":"Moon Maniac Meet","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"There are a lot of furries out there that have moon or other celestial bodies as important parts or their sonas' designs. I want to meet fellow space lovers. Come talk about space and furries. Better wear your eclipse glasses, because we're taking group photos."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Fenlan","Takiumi"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,23,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_91_","Title":"Murrsuit Meetup","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A murrsuit meetup and open discussion. This is a social gathering and a panel to discuss and inform. First half is informative, the second half is social. Please have your bits covered."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Sky Rune; Nikolai"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,14,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 02:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_92_","Title":"Name that RPG Tune!","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"RPG Music Lovers rejoice!  Come join your fellow game music fans for a sesh of \"Name That Tune\", RPG style!  From old-school to modern, from western to eastern, from triple-A to Indie, if you know the name of the game, you can win prizes!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Werb"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,20,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 08:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_93_","Title":"Nerd-Squared: Bully Kink Meetup","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A meet for bullies and nerds! Wear your best gear and get ready to yank some waistbands. Make some friends who will torment you for the rest of your life!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Yonek Yote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,16,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 04:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_94_","Title":"Not Famous Canines Meetup","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Are you a lesser known species from the dog family Canidae? Come scamper on over and meet and greet other not-so-famous dog species from coyotes, dholes, dingoes, African Wild dogs, jackals, and much more! Howl along, play along, learn along together as a mix-mashed, improvised pack!"},{"tags":["Convention"],"Track":"Convention","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy Badger"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,17,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 05:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_95_","Title":"Now This Is How You Exorcise A Con","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"The haunting is done. The ghosts must leave. Conventus fuit, nunc est bibendum."},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Alkali","Boozy Badger","Iggy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,18,30],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 06:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_96_","Title":"Open Mic & Comedy Basics","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Have a stand-up routine you want to try out? Want to tell a story you think will give us a chuckle? Come try it out at Fur Squared Open Mic! One could not ask for a friendlier atmosphere. After your act, be ready to receive some helpful good natured critiques from the panel hosts. All performers are limited to 3 to 5 minute sets depending on the panel turn out."},{"tags":["Convention"],"Track":"Convention","Speakers":["Axel Malamute","MLW","Kashiru"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,11,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 11:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_97_","Title":"Opening Ceremonies","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Don your masquerade masks and gather with your fellow spirits! The opening ceremonies of FurSquared's Haunted Masquerade are certain to delight you with future visions of what to expect over the weekend, and what fun surprises might be in store! It's a ball so great, everyone's dying to attend!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Serathin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_98_","Title":"Otherkin Meet and Greet","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Soared through the skies a dragon?  More of the canine persuasion instead?  This is the place for otherkin and therians to meet and share stories about lives past and present!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["keyotter","Rhubarb Nido","A Fox Named Coyote; Cornel the Otter; Tonic Raccoon; DragoVox; Dittman Rat; Scarecrow; Aries; MelancholySeabiscuit; Gale Tazzin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,20,21,0],"Date":"Thursday","Time":"Thursday @ 09:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_99_","Title":"Otter Chaos Rehearsal","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A closed music rehearsal. Not a public event."},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["keyotter; Rhubarb Nido","A Fox Named Coyote; Cornel the Otter; Tonic Raccoon; DragoVox; Dittman Rat; Scarecrow; Aries; MelancholySeabiscuit; Gale Tazzin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,24,0],"Date":"Monday","Time":"Monday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_100_","Title":"Otter Chaos!","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Otter Chaos! is a furry video game music band that combines jazz improv with tunes from your favorite games such as Mario, Zelda, Sonic, and Pokémon. The result is a uniquely chaotic show featuring an eclectic group of instruments including accordion, electric violin, trombones, drums, and more!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Pepper Coyote","With approximately 5 special guests!"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,21,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 09:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_101_","Title":"Pepper Coyote - AFTER DARK (with boobs)","Room":"S201","Abstract":"You know that song? That one song? The one about the horse? Yeah Pepper wrote that. Come hear 10-12 songs that AREN'T the horse one, and then the horse one. Bring money for charity!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Pepper Coyote","With approximately 4 special guests!"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,17,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 05:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_102_","Title":"Pepper Coyote in concert! (All ages)","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Beloved furry musician Pepper Coyote takes the stage to knock your socks off with dizzying vocals, show-stopping jokes, and passable guitar playing. Come hear heartfelt originals and old favorites from the fandom's premier vocal act."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Delta Diogenes"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,12,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_103_","Title":"Pet Play 102: Archetypes and Creativity","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"So you get the idea of Pet Play... but how do you fit your unique self, and unique sona, into a kink community that seems dominated by clones of the same young cis gay male puppy archetype? In this interactive course, we'll explore strategies for modifying common Pet archetypes, as well as creating our own from scratch, to practice expressing our unique selves as Pet Players."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Scamper Corgi","Fiishu"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,15,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 03:30 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_104_","Title":"Punks'r'us","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Do you identify as punk and have anarcho views? Come hang out with other punk furries and listen to music! We will have a swap table if you'd like to donate anything to help out someone else! You don't have to dress punk to be punk."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Icewolf"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,17,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 05:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_105_","Title":"RC Furry Meet-up!","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Are you into radio controlled vehicles? Do you want to learn more about different rc vehicles? Then come to this meet up and meet fellow furs who are also into this hobby! Share your cars, tracks, projects or just come and mingle!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Dittman Rat"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:30 AM, 30 minutes","key":"_event_106_","Title":"Ratmos in Concert","Room":"S201","Abstract":"It's become a yearly tradition for Dittman to get sidetracked all winter, then go into a sudden frenzy creating a setlist and agonizing over guitar effects and cramming in practice time in order to play some atmospheric rodent rock at Fur Squared! .....I think that gives you the gist. For fans of Moleplay, Rattiohead, Gnashing Pumpkins, The Rattional, and Chew2."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Bash the Piñata"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,23,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_107_","Title":"Reading Furry Tarot","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Join us for some fun tarot readings using the Journey of the Animal furry tarot deck by Inanimorphs, learn the different types of cards, and how to learn to read."},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["TheToader"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,11,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 11:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_108_","Title":"Relaxing Video Game Music","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Escape from the bustle and listen to video game classics reimagined for acoustic instruments. TheToader brings his unique blend of classical guitar, accordion, and mandola to life in this relaxing musical journey. Listen to acoustic arrangements from The Legend of Zelda, Xenoblade Chronicles, Yoshi, and more."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Lilia Roo","Purple Dragonmage"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_109_","Title":"Retro Computing and Collecting","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Experience the joy and intrigue of old computers! Join Lilia and Purple and they introduce the hobby of retrocomputing, the many reasons why people collect these old machines, and how to get started."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Lilia Roo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,13,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_110_","Title":"Reviving Dead Online Worlds","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Is there an online-only game near and dear to your heart that shut down years ago? Great news: it may be possible to bring it back! Lilia Roo will demonstrate how to write a new server for a long-dead game. Basic knowledge of software development is recommended."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Avery Rhea"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,13,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_111_","Title":"Rock Climbing/Bouldering Furs Meetup","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Come learn about rock climbing and find other furs with a mutual interest! For anybody new to it we will discuss what it is and how to get into it. This will be a perfect place for furs to find friends to climb together with as well as learn about the local climbing gyms."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Dittman Rat"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,21,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 09:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_112_","Title":"Rodent Meet and Squeak","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Following a successful infestation in Rosemont, IL, rodents of unusual sizes are  now converging in Milwaukee to meet, greet, and squeak! Depending who you ask, this is either a casual gathering, a party, or a global domination meeting, but everyone agrees it's the place to be for rodents and rodent lovers."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Dustin DaHusky","Bonfire Staff"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,24,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_113_","Title":"SEWI Furs Bonfire Meet","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"The longest running bonfire meet in WI since 2015 that began in Dustin’s backyard that became a local favorite every summer season. At this panel the bonfire staff will discuss our wonderful venue at Marsh Haven Nature Center in Waupun, our colorful history over the years, and our plans for the 2025 bonfire season. Questions and suggestions are welcomed!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["LycanthropyLive"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,14,30],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 02:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_114_","Title":"Scales & Slime Meetup!","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Calling all critters scaly, slimy, aquatic, and insectoid! Stop by to mingle, take photos, and chat with your fellow non-mammalian furs. Fursuits not required - come as you are!  Free buttons will be provided to the first 50 attendees."},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Iggy","Status Ferret"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,11,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 11:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_115_","Title":"Scribbles N Bits","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A creative writing 'game'.  You submit how you'd like to continue the story.  We'll read off the choices and the popular vote determines what becomes the next line in the story.  Repeat until we have a story!  Don't forget the moral round at the end!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Shallie Dragon"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,13,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_116_","Title":"Shallie Dragon in Concert","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Shallie returns to FurSquared to share her latest musical creations, as well as a selection of her favorite tunes. Heavy metal? Ambient? EDM? Pop? Who knows what she'll have to offer? But that's part of the fun!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Alkali"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_117_","Title":"So This Is Your First Fur Con?","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"Is this your first time at a fun con? Or even just your first time at Fur Squared. Well come on in and learn the dos and Don’ts of being at a fur con. From dealing with fur suits to the 6/2/1 rule. A great way to start your convention and learn the best way to have a good time."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Nikolai"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,24,0],"Date":"Monday","Time":"Monday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_118_","Title":"Sober/Teetotal Furs Meetup","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"If drinking isn't part of your lifestyle, come meet and support other alcohol-free furries."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["a fox named coyote"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,14,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 02:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_119_","Title":"Songwriting Workshop","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"Let's talk songwriting! How to get started, song structure, music theory, where to find inspiration, and more!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Deyna the BatCat"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,18,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 06:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_120_","Title":"Spooky Furres Meetup","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Meetup for furries that stay on the darker side and have an enjoyment of the creepy, kooky, mysterious and spooky! We're all-together Ooky!    Join the spooky side and see what we're all about if you're curious, and stay for the creepy conversation ranging from local hauntings and paranormal experience to your favorite spooky movie!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Bandit","Fraye","Flint"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,20,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 08:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_121_","Title":"Stories From Furst Response","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Ready to hear some stories in Furst Response from Bandit, Flint, and Fraye? Then stop on by while we talk about some of the shenanigans that we have gotten into from cons to the real world and the lessons we have learned in our careers. After we get the stories started, join in and tell your story as a Furst Responder."},{"tags":["Gaming / Competition"],"Track":"Games","Speakers":["Justin Jackalope"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,24,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 12:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_122_","Title":"Streetpass Meet","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Where fans of the 3DS and 2DS can swap Streetpass data, as I talk about the history of the 3DS and how many of its games wound up on the Switch. Also (If allowed) a Swap meet for 3DS and DS games."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Iggy","Alkali","Pandez"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,13,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 01:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_123_","Title":"Super Password Plus","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"It's back and better than ever! The game of secret words! You and our celebrity guests team up to give the right clue to get your partner to say the secret word. Each of the five passwords in a round combine as clues towards a riddle to solve. Alkali still hates this game."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Citrine Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,10,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 10:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_124_","Title":"The Blind Side","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Have you ever wondered what it is like to be blind?  Join Citrine for an in-depth discussion about what it’s like to be without sight in a sighted world.  Be sure to bring your questions."},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Vidar","Arka Barka","Lapis","Tugo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,21,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 09:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_125_","Title":"The Dog Park","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"A place where canine characters and canine lovers can come to meet new people, music will be playing and we will have board games."},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Status Ferret"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,10,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 10:00 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_126_","Title":"The Fifth Annual FurSquared Spelling Bee","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"The fifth annual FurSquared spelling bee.  Come test your brain at the Spelling Bee for some barely-above-mediocre prizes!"},{"tags":["Other"],"Track":"Other","Speakers":["OxideFox","Nitrous Fox","Roscoe Rohernstern"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,11,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:00 AM, 360 minutes","key":"_event_127_","Title":"The Model Train Show at Fursquared","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Come on out to the first (official) Model Train Show at Fursquared! This will be a gathering of layouts and collections brought by your peers to share the hobby of model railroading together at the con! Do you want to exhibit at the show? Contact @RoscoeRohernstern on Telegram! This is NOT a swap meet and will focus on collections and layouts brought to the show"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Alkali","Draggor","Iggy"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,14,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 02:00 PM, 90 minutes","key":"_event_128_","Title":"The Original Whose Lion is it Anyway?","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Based off of the popular TV show “Whose Line is it Anyway,” this is everyone’s chance to get up on stage and improvise with their fellow furs! A completely interactive panel, Whose Lion will feature such games as: Questions Only, Who’s Line, Party Quirks, and even World’s Worst. Hosted by Alkali, this panel is sure to be a good time for all!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Flopperton"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,14,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 02:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_129_","Title":"Trades Furs Meetup","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Is your dog-collar a blue collar? Do you work with your paws? Make things? Fix things for your job? That's who we are. Come by and say \"Hi.\""},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Serathin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,22,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 10:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_130_","Title":"Transformation Lovers Anonymous","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Enjoy transformations, or perhaps are a secret shapeshifter looking to mingle?  This panel is all about transformation in the furry fandom, from triggers to types, and the eternal debate of poof vs. prolonged.  Be careful, you might not leave the same fur you came in!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Kiva"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,15,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_131_","Title":"Two Wheeled Furs","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"A panel to discuss everything and everything to do with motorcycles! Cruisers, supersports, dirt riders, track day junkies, moto adventurers, old riders, newbies and everything else in-between!"},{"tags":["Musical Performance"],"Track":"Music","Speakers":["Status Ferret","Citrine Husky"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,16,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_132_","Title":"UHF: United Husky and Ferret","Room":"S201","Abstract":"Come join two furry musicians as we jam out to hits from yesterday, today, and tomorrow!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Amicus Verum"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,21,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 09:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_133_","Title":"Vore Meet & Eat","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"This is a meet and greet for furs into vorarephilia. If you have interest and/or are curious about the topic, feel free to stop by! This is going to be a mix of some education and fun, as well as being a great way to meet others with similar interests!"},{"tags":["Audience Interactive (Game shows, competitions, etc.)"],"Track":"Audience Interactive","Speakers":["Dittman Rat"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,23,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 11:00 PM, 30 minutes","key":"_event_134_","Title":"We (Don't?) Wanna Be Ghosts!","Room":"Crystal","Abstract":"I've made up a campfire game that I've never tested and that may or may not have \"Don't\" in the title. But it's going to be spooky and hilarious. Just trust me. No actual campfires involved."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Rain/Lydia Shinotsu"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,18,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 06:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_135_","Title":"Weasels: the Wacky, Wild Wonders","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Whether you already know and love weasels or have barely a passing knowledge of them, this panel will aim to teach you something new about these adorably ferocious critters, so that you can come to appreciate them as much as I do. (though I am a weasel too…)"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Bash the Piñata"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,21,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 09:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_136_","Title":"Werewolves and Shapeshifters - TF in Folklore and Fiction","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"From shamanic traditions to ancient werewolves, from kitsune to werehyenas, from the Big Bad Wolf to modern werewolves. Join us for a look at human to animal transformations, how they were portrayed in our histories, folklore, legends, and modern stories."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Axel Malamute","Draggor"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,24,30],"Date":"Monday","Time":"Monday @ 12:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_137_","Title":"What Does That Car Ad Online Really Mean?","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"During the panel Draggor will find interesting Facebook ads for interesting vehicles and I will read between the lines on what that really means and between ads I will be answering car advice and questions."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Majic Records","Fly To The Night","TheKitoDiet","Jaylaflame","$leazy EZ"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,16,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_138_","Title":"What Makes You Furry?","Room":"S201","Abstract":"What makes you furry? A discussion about belonging in the fandom, and finding community within the community."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Aves"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,16,0],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 04:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_139_","Title":"What do DJs actually do?","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Ever wonder what it takes to play on a convention's mainstage? Come learn about all the basics of DJing and start your journey!"},{"tags":["Entertainment / Non-musical Performance / Comedy"],"Track":"Entertainment","Speakers":["Chewie","Techno","wolfletech","Flow","Tango","Korupi"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,21,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 09:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_140_","Title":"Who gave Chewy a Mic!","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Chewy gathers her friends to talk about chaos and fun!"},{"tags":["Social (Meet & Greets)"],"Track":"Social","Speakers":["Twin Swords"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,22,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 10:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_141_","Title":"Why Blue Dog?","Room":"Pabst","Abstract":"Why do we make blue canine fursonas? Where does it start and why won't it end? Are you a blue dog looking to meet other azure canine friends? Maybe you're curious to see how many of these blue sonas exist! Join Twin as he does a dive into the origins of blue, dogs, and how to mash them together in \"Why Blue Dog?\""},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Toucanarama/Samson Toucanson"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,21,22,0],"Date":"Friday","Time":"Friday @ 10:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_142_","Title":"Working with Birds","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"Interested in learning more about careers in wildlife biology and conservation? Ever wondered what it would be like to work with birds professionally? Come learn about bird banding and bird conservation careers with an ornithologist from the Milwaukee County Zoo!"},{"tags":["Creative Arts (Art / Drawing / Crafts / Writing)"],"Track":"Creative Arts","Speakers":["Serathin"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,15,0],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 03:00 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_143_","Title":"Writing 101","Room":"Walker","Abstract":"For those interested in putting together their first story, whether it be furry or otherwise.  Join Serathin as he shares his insights in the writing world, sharing hints and tricks for those just starting out.  For those that are ready to write or just curious!"},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Lilia Roo"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,23,14,30],"Date":"Sunday","Time":"Sunday @ 02:30 PM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_144_","Title":"Your City Listens to Furries","Room":"MacArthur","Abstract":"A two-paragraph email to the right person can put actual infrastructure on your street. In this panel, Lilia Roo will share techniques that actually work for getting things fixed or improved in your city, all while keeping your free time intact."},{"tags":["Educational (Discussion, Presentation)"],"Track":"Educational","Speakers":["Lune"],"dateArgs":[2025,1,22,11,30],"Date":"Saturday","Time":"Saturday @ 11:30 AM, 60 minutes","key":"_event_145_","Title":"Zoids, Zoids, Zoids! And Gunpla!","Room":"Mitchell","Abstract":"Coming at you again this year, Lune is here to teach you about the wonderful world of the zoids multimedia project and model kits in general. This year will have models to show off and focus on how to get into the hobby. Builds can be brought or if you want to show photos send them to: lune_bun on discord."}];